# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial solves a cardinality-constrained portfolio optimization problem: given the constraint of holding exactly $K$ assets, balance risk, return, and diversification objectives to find the set of optimal portfolios.\n"
msgstr "Nilulutas ng tutorial na ito ang isang cardinality-constrained na problema sa portfolio optimization: dahil sa constraint na humawak ng eksaktong $K$ asset, balansehin ang mga layunin sa risk, return, at diversification para mahanap ang hanay ng mga optimal na portfolio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing this tutorial, you can expect to understand:\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang tutorial na ito, maaasahan mong maiintindihan mo ang:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to express a portfolio-selection problem with three competing objectives &mdash; low risk, high return, and good diversification &mdash; as a quantum optimization problem.\n"
msgstr "Paano ipahayag ang isang problema sa pagpili ng portfolio na may tatlong magkakalabang layunin &mdash; mababang risk, mataas na return, at mahusay na diversification &mdash; bilang isang quantum optimization problem.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How a single QAOA circuit, swept over a set of objective weights, traces out a *Pareto front* of optimal trade-off portfolios.\n"
msgstr "Paano ang isang QAOA circuit, na iniikot sa isang hanay ng mga objective weight, ay gumuguhit ng *Pareto front* ng mga optimal na trade-off na portfolio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How an XY mixer keeps the search inside the \"choose exactly K assets\" subspace, so no penalty term is needed and feasibility is enforced by post-selecting the measured bitstrings.\n"
msgstr "Paano pinananatili ng isang XY mixer ang paghahanap sa loob ng subspace na \"pumili ng eksaktong K asset\", kaya hindi na kailangan ng penalty term at ipinapatupad ang feasibility sa pamamagitan ng post-selection ng mga nasukat na bitstring.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to train the circuit's angles with a matrix-product-state simulator at a scale too large to optimize exactly, following Kotil et al. (arXiv:2503.22797).\n"
msgstr "Paano sanayin ang mga angle ng circuit gamit ang matrix-product-state simulator sa sukat na masyadong malaki para i-optimize nang eksakto, kasunod ng Kotil et al. (arXiv:2503.22797).\n"

